---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro'
---
<section id="profile" class="design-section relative border-b border-[#bdc7d2] scroll-mt-[90px]"><div class="section-inner mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-[3.7%] py-[46px] max-md:px-6 max-md:py-[34px] min-[1440px]:px-[54px]">
<SectionHeading number="03" title="ABOUT" description="実装だけでなく、整理から伴走します。" />
<div class="about-layout grid grid-cols-[44%_56%] items-center max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-7"><div class="about-person flex items-center gap-7" data-reveal><img class="about-person-image h-[140px] w-[140px] rounded-full object-cover grayscale max-md:h-[100px] max-md:w-[100px]" src="/assets/images/profile.jpg" alt="ぐみ" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" /><div><h3 class="about-person-name font-raleway text-[30px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.04em] max-md:text-[27px]">ぐみ</h3><p class="about-person-role mt-2 text-[13px]">Web開発パートナー</p><a class="about-person-link focus-ring mt-5 inline-block border-b border-[#e84093] pb-1 text-xs" href="https://note.com/gumigumih" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">noteを見る <span aria-hidden="true">⟶</span></a></div></div><div class="about-copy border-l border-[#bdc7d2] pl-10 text-sm leading-[2] text-[#394452] max-md:border-l-0 max-md:pl-0"><p class="about-copy-paragraph">フロントエンドとバックエンドを横断して、Web制作・開発に取り組んでいます。</p><p class="about-copy-paragraph mt-2.5">要件の整理から設計、実装、公開後の運用まで。Web開発とプロジェクト推進、両方の視点で前に進めます。</p><p class="about-copy-paragraph mt-2.5">実装だけのご相談も、仕様を固める前のご相談も歓迎です。</p></div></div>
</div></section>
